Our M-Pesa integration plan

1. STK Push
Customer-initiated prompt
The business enters the amount and customer's phone number, or the customer starts checkout. Safaricom sends a payment prompt, and SPS processes the resulting callback.




2. Paybill and Till (C2B)
Direct customer payment
Customers pay using the business's configured Paybill or Till. Safaricom sends SPS a notification that can be recorded without manual entry.




3. Reliable payment records
SPS stores the M-Pesa receipt, amount, time, phone number, payment reference and processing status. Duplicate callbacks must not create duplicate payments.




4. Live business dashboard
Display confirmed collections, pending payments, failed payments and unmatched Paybill/Till receipts.